flowchart TD
    In["<b>1. frame enters bridge port</b><br/>skb carries src/dst MAC,<br/>VLAN, and ingress port<br/><b>handoff:</b> bridge must<br/>learn before it forwards<br/><b>state:</b> skb associated<br/>with a br_port"]

    Learn["<b>2. learn source</b><br/>record src MAC/VLAN to<br/>ingress port, refresh age<br/><b>handoff:</b> dst decision<br/>can use updated FDB<br/><b>state:</b> reverse traffic<br/>can become known unicast"]

    Policy["<b>3. bridge policy</b><br/>check port state, STP,<br/>VLAN filtering, local delivery<br/><b>handoff:</b> only forwarding<br/>ports may send onward<br/><b>state:</b> allowed, locally<br/>consumed, or dropped"]

    Lookup["<b>4. destination lookup</b><br/>search FDB for dst MAC/VLAN<br/><b>handoff:</b> hit selects one port,<br/>miss/broadcast selects flood set<br/><b>state:</b> egress port list known"]

    Egress["<b>5. egress copies</b><br/>queue one skb for known<br/>unicast or clone for flood<br/><b>handoff:</b> selected ports<br/>pass frames to qdisc/driver<br/><b>state:</b> one or many egress skbs"]

    Drop["<b>drop / consume</b><br/>no egress frame"]

    In --> Learn --> Policy --> Lookup --> Egress
    Policy -. blocked or local .-> Drop

    classDef br fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    class In,Learn,Policy,Lookup br
    class Egress ok
    class Drop bad
